    "title": "Crime Stoppers: Do you recognize this person? - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shajaka Shelton ,\n1 hours ago LANSING, Mich. (WLNS) — This week on Crime Stoppers, police need your help tracking down someone who used fraudulent money at a business in Lansing.\nIf you have information regarding the cases below, call Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan at (517) 483-STOP. You can remain anonymous.\nThose who contact Crime Stoppers with information can receive up to a $1,000 award.\nUse of fraudulent money The Lansing Police Department is asking for help identifying the person pictured below, who they say used fraudulent money to make several purchases at a Lansing business on Dec. 19, 2025.\nA person wanted in connection with the use of fraudulent money at a Lansing business. (Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan). Copyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WLNS 6 News.",
